.TH AVR\-ORG\-INSTALL\-REMOVE 1 "" "avr 0.5.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-org-install-remove \- Remove an installation using its provider-specific lifecycle.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr org install remove
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove an installation using its provider-specific lifecycle.
.PP
GitHub installations are suspended. GitLab installations are permanently disconnected, including their Avrea history; use `avr org install rotate` for a credential problem instead. Pass --yes to skip confirmation.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    action, installation_id, organization_id, platform
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-installation\-id\fR \fITEXT\fR
Installation ID to remove (ins-xxx format) (required)
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR, \fB\-y\fR
Skip confirmation prompt.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-org-install (1),
.BR avr-org-install-add (1),
.BR avr-org-install-list (1),
.BR avr-org-install-rotate (1),
.BR avr-org-install-runner (1),
.BR avr-org-install-set-selection (1)
